#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:42
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Readline"
msgstr "Instalação do Readline"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Reinstalling Readline will cause the old libraries to be moved to "
"&lt;libraryname&gt;.old. While this is normally not a problem, in some cases"
" it can trigger a linking bug in <command>ldconfig</command>. This can be "
"avoided by issuing the following two seds:"
msgstr ""
"Reinstalar Readline causará as bibliotecas antigas serem movidas para "
"&lt;nomebiblioteca&gt;.old. Ao tempo em que isso normalmente não seja um "
"problema, em alguns casos isso pode deflagrar um defeito de vinculação no "
"<command>ldconfig</command>. Isso pode ser evitado emitindo-se os seguintes "
"dois seds:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:49
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/MV.*old/d' Makefile.in\n"
"sed -i '/{OLDSUFF}/c:' support/shlib-install</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/MV.*old/d' Makefile.in\n"
"sed -i '/{OLDSUFF}/c:' support/shlib-install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:52
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Prevent hard coding library search paths (rpath) into the shared libraries."
"  This package does not need rpath for an installation into the standard "
"location, and rpath may sometimes cause unwanted effects or even security "
"issues:"
msgstr ""
"Evite caminhos de pesquisa de biblioteca de codificação rígida (rpath) "
"dentro das bibliotecas compartilhadas. Esse pacote não precisa do rpath para"
" uma instalação no local padrão, e o rpath às vezes pode causar efeitos "
"indesejados ou até mesmo problemas de segurança:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:57
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i 's/-Wl,-rpath,[^ ]*//' support/shobj-conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i 's/-Wl,-rpath,[^ ]*//' support/shobj-conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:60
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Fix a problem identified upstream specifically for this version of readline:"
msgstr ""
"Corrija um problema identificado pelo fluxo de desenvolvimento "
"especificamente para essa versão da readline:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:63
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e '270a\\\n"
"     else\\\n"
"       chars_avail = 1;'      \\\n"
"    -e '288i\\   result = -1;' \\\n"
"    -i.orig input.c</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e '270a\\\n"
"     else\\\n"
"       chars_avail = 1;'      \\\n"
"    -e '288i\\   result = -1;' \\\n"
"    -i.orig input.c</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:69
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare Readline for compilation:"
msgstr "Prepare Readline para compilação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:71
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --disable-static \\\n"
"            --with-curses    \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/readline-&readline-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --disable-static \\\n"
"            --with-curses    \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/readline-&readline-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:77
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the new configure option:"
msgstr "O significado da nova opção do configure:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--with-curses</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--with-curses</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:82
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This option tells Readline that it can find the termcap library functions in"
" the curses library, not a separate termcap library. This will generate the "
"correct <filename>readline.pc</filename> file."
msgstr ""
"Essa opção diz ao Readline que ela pode encontrar as funções da biblioteca "
"termcap na biblioteca curses, não uma biblioteca termcap separada. Isso "
"gerará o arquivo <filename>readline.pc</filename> correto."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid "Compile the package:"
msgstr "Compile o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:93
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"make\">make SHLIB_LIBS=\"-lncursesw\"</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"make\">make SHLIB_LIBS=\"-lncursesw\"</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the make option:"
msgstr "O significado da opção do make:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:99
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>SHLIB_LIBS=\"-lncursesw\"</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>SHLIB_LIBS=\"-lncursesw\"</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This option forces Readline to link against the <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libncursesw</filename> library.  For details see the "
"<quote>Shared Libraries</quote> section in the package's "
"<filename>README</filename> file."
msgstr ""
"Essa opção força o Readline a vincular-se à biblioteca <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libncursesw</filename>. Para detalhes, veja-se a seção"
" <quote>Bibliotecas Compartilhadas</quote> no arquivo "
"<filename>README</filename> do pacote."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:110
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:114
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:116
#, xml-text
msgid "If desired, install the documentation:"
msgstr "Se desejado, instale a documentação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/readline.xml:118
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">install -v -m644 doc/*.{ps,pdf,html,dvi} "
"/usr/share/doc/readline-&readline-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">install -v -m644 doc/*.{ps,pdf,html,dvi} "
"/usr/share/doc/readline-&readline-version;</userinput>"

